01:05.379 --> 01:05.517
[ rumbling]
[隆隆声]

01:08.068 --> 01:08.206
Here they come, lads!
他们来了，小伙子们！

01:09.344 --> 01:09.482
Hooray!
万岁！

01:11.000 --> 01:11.137
[ flatly]:
Fantastic.
[平淡]：
太棒了。

01:12.620 --> 01:12.758
[ crowd exclaiming]
[人群惊呼]

01:14.689 --> 01:14.827
Thank you very much, madam.
非常感谢您，女士。

01:16.034 --> 01:16.172
[ cash register jingling]
[收银机叮当响]

01:20.896 --> 01:21.000
I feel so alive!
我感觉自己还活着！

01:24.310 --> 01:24.448
♪ Cha-ching, cha-ching,
cha-chingaree ♪
♪ 查清，查清，
查琴加里 ♪

01:27.344 --> 01:27.482
♪ Money, oh, money,
how I love thee ♪
♪ 钱，哦，钱，
我多么爱你♪

01:30.344 --> 01:30.482
♪ Cha-ching, cha-chong,
cha-changaroo ♪
♪ 查清，查冲，
茶昌加鲁 ♪

01:33.137 --> 01:33.275
♪ From pennies to dollars
any amount'll do ♪
♪ 从便士到美元
任何数量都可以♪

01:36.551 --> 01:36.689
♪ Cha-ching, cha-ching,
it's no contest ♪
♪ 查清，查清，
这不是比赛♪

01:39.827 --> 01:39.965
♪ There's only one thing
that I love the best ♪
♪ 只有一件事
我最喜欢的♪

01:42.896 --> 01:43.000
♪ From every sight
I've ever seen ♪
♪ 从每一个角度
我见过♪

01:46.000 --> 01:46.137
♪ To the sweetest sound
I've heard ♪
♪ 最甜美的声音
我听说过♪

01:48.655 --> 01:48.793
♪ I'd gladly give up
everything ♪
♪ 我很乐意放弃
一切♪

01:52.310 --> 01:52.448
♪ For all the money
