♪ 为了所有的钱
这是我赚到的♪

01:55.413 --> 01:55.551
♪ Cha-ching, cha-ching,
cha-chingaree ♪
♪ 查清，查清，
查琴加里 ♪

01:58.758 --> 01:58.896
♪ There's nothing on earth
like the feeling of greed! ♪
♪ 地球上什么都没有
喜欢贪婪的感觉！ ♪

02:01.413 --> 02:01.551
♪ There's nothing on earth
♪ 地球上什么都没有

02:04.344 --> 02:04.482
♪ Like the feeling of greed!
♪ 喜欢贪婪的感觉！

02:08.241 --> 02:08.379
[ chortling]
[咯咯笑]

02:10.206 --> 02:10.344
Please don't
do that again.
请不要
再做一次。

02:12.724 --> 02:12.862
I think the stained-glass
barstool can go over here
我认为彩色玻璃
吧台凳可以到这里

02:15.517 --> 02:15.655
and the pseudo hand-carved
wooden sports flag display case
以及伪手工雕刻
木质运动旗帜展示柜

02:18.448 --> 02:18.586
can go over there.
可以去那里。

02:19.827 --> 02:19.965
Ahoy there,
matey.
哎呀，那里，
马蒂。

02:21.275 --> 02:21.413
Can I help
you gentlemen?
我可以帮忙吗
你们先生们？

02:22.448 --> 02:22.586
Are you the owner?
你是业主吗？

02:23.827 --> 02:23.965
Who wants
to know?
谁想要
知道吗？

02:25.172 --> 02:25.310
Allow me to introduce myself.
请允许我自我介绍一下。

02:27.103 --> 02:27.241
Howard Blandy, President,
Blandy Franchising Company.
霍华德·布兰迪总统，
布兰迪特许经营公司。

02:28.517 --> 02:28.655
Howard Blandy!
霍华德·布兰迪！

02:30.034 --> 02:30.172
You mean the
Howard Blandy?
你的意思是
霍华德·布兰迪？

02:31.724 --> 02:31.862
The Howard Blandy
that masterminded
霍华德·布兰迪
那个策划的

02:33.758 --> 02:33.896
the ruthless takeover of every
small, family-owned business
无情地接管每一个
小型家族企业

02:36.724 --> 02:36.862
in Bikini Bottom?
在比基尼底部？

02:37.931 --> 02:38.034
ThatHoward Blandy?
那个霍华德·布兰迪？

02:40.551 --> 02:40.689
I worship you!
我崇拜你！

02:43.344 --> 02:43.482
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

02:44.862 --> 02:44.965
Get it together
a little, man.
把它放在一起
有一点，伙计。

02:46.586 --> 02:46.724
Sorry, it's just that...
you're rich.
抱歉，只是这样...
你很有钱。

02:51.068 --> 02:51.206
I'm Mr. Krabs.
我是蟹老板。

02:53.517 --> 02:53.655
To what do I owe
the honor
我欠什么
荣誉

02:55.137 --> 02:55.275
of having you here,
Howard?
有你在这里，
霍华德？

02:56.931 --> 02:57.034
What would it take
to buy the Krusty Krab?
需要什么
买蟹堡王？

02:59.034 --> 02:59.172
Buy the Krusty Krab?!
买蟹堡王？！

03:00.965 --> 03:01.068
It's not for sale.
它不出售。

03:02.517 --> 03:02.655
You know,
I may not make as much
你知道，
我可能赚不到那么多

03:04.310 --> 03:04.448
as your fancy-schmancy
mega restaurant chain,
作为你的幻想
大型连锁餐厅，

03:06.689 --> 03:06.827
but it's the blood, sweat
and tears of a hard day's work.
但这是血、汗
和一天辛苦工作的泪水。

03:10.448 --> 03:10.586
It's not about the...
这不是关于...

03:11.793 --> 03:11.931
Holy sweet mother of pearl!
神圣甜蜜的珍珠母！

03:14.310 --> 03:14.448
I like the way you think,
Blandy.
我喜欢你的思考方式
布兰迪。

03:16.620 --> 03:16.758
But it'll take
a lot more
但这需要
还有很多

03:18.172 --> 03:18.310
than a suitcase
full of cash
比一个手提箱
充满现金

03:19.827 --> 03:19.965
to buy the Krusty
Krab from me.
购买库斯蒂
蟹从我这里来。

03:21.655 --> 03:21.793
Oh, there's
a lot more than that.
哦，有
远不止于此。

03:23.241 --> 03:23.379
The rest is over there.
其余的都在那边。

03:24.931 --> 03:25.034
Jumping King Neptune!
跳跃的海王星王！

03:29.655 --> 03:29.793
Sold-- give
me my money.
售出--给予
我的钱。

03:31.000 --> 03:31.137
First, sign this contract.
首先，签署本合同。

03:33.000 --> 03:33.103
You relinquish the Krusty Krab
and all ownership thereof
你放弃了蟹堡王
及其所有所有权

03:36.172 --> 03:36.310
along with its employees,
merchandise, logos
与其员工一起，
商品、标志

03:38.655 --> 03:38.793
and cash registers.
和收银机。

03:40.103 --> 03:40.241
I still get the money?Yes.
我还能拿到钱吗？是的。

03:41.344 --> 03:41.482
That'll be fine then.
那就好了。

03:42.517 --> 03:42.655
Here you go.
干得好。

03:43.965 --> 03:44.068
Now, give me,
give me!
现在，给我，
给我！

03:44.931 --> 03:45.034
Whoo-ha!
呼哈！

03:47.000 --> 03:47.103
See you 'round!
再见！

03:54.034 --> 03:54.172
What's happening?
发生什么事了？

03:56.068 --> 03:56.206
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

03:58.000 --> 03:58.103
Mr. Krabs, they're putting up
pennants in the Krusty Krab.
螃蟹先生，他们正在忍受
蟹堡王中的锦旗。

04:01.482 --> 04:01.620
What's going on?
这是怎么回事？

04:02.586 --> 04:02.724
I'm retiring!
我要退休了！

04:04.206 --> 04:04.344
Retiring?
退休？

04:05.620 --> 04:05.758
I'm free to do whatever I want.
我可以自由地做任何我想做的事。

04:07.931 --> 04:08.034
I can learn how to ride
that bicycle I got 30 years ago.
我可以学习如何骑车
我三十年前买的那辆自行车。

04:11.275 --> 04:11.413
Or go to the new hook museum
downtown.
或者去新钩博物馆
市中心。

04:14.379 --> 04:14.517
Or ever paint bowls of fruit.
或者画一碗水果。

04:16.931 --> 04:17.034
Aren't you
happy for me?
你不是吗
为我高兴吗？

04:18.586 --> 04:18.724
I sure am.
我当然是。

04:20.241 --> 04:20.379
So long, boys!
再见，孩子们！

04:21.448 --> 04:21.586
Have fun, Mr. Krabs.
玩得开心吧，蟹老板。

04:25.896 --> 04:26.000
Heaven knows
I won't.
天知道
我不会。

04:27.310 --> 04:27.448
Hi, gentlemen.
嗨，先生们。

04:28.793 --> 04:28.931
I'm Carl,
your new manager.
我是卡尔，
你的新经理。

04:30.413 --> 04:30.551
New manager?
新经理？

04:32.241 --> 04:32.344
I think you'll find
working at the Krabby O'Mondays
我想你会发现
在 Krabby O'Mondays 工作

04:34.551 --> 04:34.689
to be both a learning experience
and an enjoyable one.
既是一种学习经历
和一个令人愉快的。

04:37.655 --> 04:37.793
Krabby O'Mondays?
蟹蟹周一？

04:39.482 --> 04:39.620
You won't need
these anymore.
你不需要
就这些了。

04:41.586 --> 04:41.724
Now, here are
your new uniforms
现在，这里有
你的新制服

04:43.103 --> 04:43.241
and here are the...
这是...

04:44.862 --> 04:44.965
employee manuals.
员工手册。

04:47.310 --> 04:47.448
See you
first thing tomorrow.
再见
明天第一件事。

04:48.931 --> 04:49.034
[ straining]
[紧张]

04:50.655 --> 04:50.793
[ engine sputtering]
[发动机溅射声]

04:54.103 --> 04:54.241
[ sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

04:55.482 --> 04:55.620
Ah...
啊...

04:57.137 --> 04:57.275
The sweet smell
of a brand new day!
甜甜的气味
全新的一天！

05:01.517 --> 05:01.655
First stop, the new hook museum.
第一站，新钩博物馆。

05:04.000 --> 05:04.103
Then maybe I'll...
那么也许我会...

05:05.310 --> 05:05.448
Hey... the Krabby O'Mondays?
嘿...蟹蟹星期一？

05:07.275 --> 05:07.413
Not the name I would've chosen.
这不是我会选择的名字。

05:09.551 --> 05:09.689
But that's all behind me now.
但现在这一切都已经过去了。

05:14.000 --> 05:14.137
RECORDED VOICE:
The three-pronged J hook
was first sighted in local water
录制的声音：
三爪J钩
首次在当地水域被发现

05:18.034 --> 05:18.172
more than one hundred years ago.
一百多年前。

05:28.344 --> 05:28.482
Wait a minute...
等一下...

05:30.241 --> 05:30.379
I hate golf!
我讨厌高尔夫！

05:36.827 --> 05:36.965
Well, I've done everything
I wanted to do
嗯，我已经做了一切
我想做

05:40.310 --> 05:40.448
and it's not even noon.
现在还不到中午。

05:43.172 --> 05:43.310
PEARL:
Did you see the shoes
she had on?
珍珠：
你看到鞋子了吗
她有吗？

05:45.000 --> 05:45.103
So last-year!
所以去年！

05:46.068 --> 05:46.206
[ laughing]
[笑]

05:47.655 --> 05:47.793
Hold on, Gina.
坚持住，吉娜。

05:48.896 --> 05:49.000
Yeah, Dad?!
是啊，爸爸？！

05:50.000 --> 05:50.137
How's it going?
怎么样了？

05:51.000 --> 05:51.103
Fine.
美好的。

05:52.137 --> 05:52.275
What're you up to?
你在忙什么？

05:53.413 --> 05:53.551
I'm talking on the phone!
我正在打电话呢！

05:54.482 --> 05:54.620
Oh, really?
哦真的吗？

05:55.482 --> 05:55.620
Really.
真的。

05:56.413 --> 05:56.551
Oh.
哦。

05:57.724 --> 05:57.862
Dad, isn't there something
爸爸，是不是有什么事情

05:59.034 --> 05:59.172
you need to do?!
你需要做什么？

06:00.620 --> 06:00.758
Well, actually
I was hoping
嗯，实际上
我本来希望

06:02.310 --> 06:02.448
you and I could do
something together.
你和我可以做
一起的东西。

06:03.275 --> 06:03.413
Get out!
出去！

06:04.413 --> 06:04.551
That's it, Dad.
就是这样，爸爸。

06:06.206 --> 06:06.344
Get a job, get a hobby,
or get some friends,
找一份工作，培养一个爱好，
或者找一些朋友，

06:08.103 --> 06:08.241
because I can't
take it anymore!
因为我不能
别再这样了！

06:10.482 --> 06:10.620
[ door slams]
[关门声]

06:11.931 --> 06:12.034
Get some friends, she says.
交一些朋友吧，她说。

06:14.689 --> 06:14.827
Find a hobby, she says.
找到一个爱好，她说。

06:16.275 --> 06:16.413
Get a job, she says.
找份工作，她说。

06:18.413 --> 06:18.551
Oh...
哦...

06:19.965 --> 06:20.068
"Help Wanted."
“把招工广告。”

06:21.241 --> 06:21.379
Hmm.
唔。

06:25.068 --> 06:25.206
[ ragtime jazz playing]
[拉格泰姆爵士乐演奏]

06:29.206 --> 06:29.344
Ahoy there, mateys.
嘿，伙计们。

06:31.413 --> 06:31.551
Welcome to the Krabby
O'Mondays...
欢迎来到克拉比
周一啊...

06:33.310 --> 06:33.448
It's my birthday.
今天是我的生日。

06:34.655 --> 06:34.793
Can I start you off with...
我可以先给你...

06:36.413 --> 06:36.551
Will you sing the Krabby
Monday's birthday song
你会唱克拉比吗
周一的生日歌

06:38.448 --> 06:38.586
to my special
little man?
给我特别的
小男人？

06:40.551 --> 06:40.689
Happy,
happy birthday...
快乐，
生日快乐...

06:42.931 --> 06:43.034
Happy, happy...
快乐，快乐……

06:44.310 --> 06:44.448
CARL:
Uh, Squidward?
卡尔：
呃，章鱼哥？

06:46.137 --> 06:46.275
Can I talk to you
for a second?
我可以和你谈谈吗
一会儿？

06:47.896 --> 06:48.000
What's our motto here
at Krabby O'Mondays?
我们的座右铭是什么
在Krabby O'Mondays？

06:51.172 --> 06:51.310
"Sincere service
with a smile."
“真诚的服务
带着微笑。”

06:53.586 --> 06:53.724
Well, yes...
嗯，是的...

06:55.206 --> 06:55.344
but with the Krabby
O'Mondays spirit.
但与蟹蟹
周一精神。

06:57.275 --> 06:57.413
Now, Squidward,
you wouldn't want
现在，章鱼哥，
你不会想要

06:59.172 --> 06:59.310
to have to talk
to Human Resources...
必须说话
到人力资源...

07:03.862 --> 07:03.965
would you?
你会吗？

07:05.275 --> 07:05.413
So, what's
our motto again?
那么，什么是
再次我们的座右铭？

07:07.827 --> 07:07.965
Uh... uh... sincere service...
with a smile.
呃……呃……真诚的服务……
带着微笑。

07:15.379 --> 07:15.517
Now you're getting it.
现在你明白了。

07:17.655 --> 07:17.793
[ humming happily]
[高兴地哼哼]

07:19.379 --> 07:19.517
Morning, SpongeBob!
早上好，海绵宝宝！

07:22.206 --> 07:22.344
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

07:25.344 --> 07:25.482
What are you
doing here?
你是什么
在这里做什么？

07:27.103 --> 07:27.241
Retirement ain't all
it's cracked up to be,
退休并不是全部
它被破解为，

07:29.310 --> 07:29.448
so I'm the new busboy.
所以我是新的服务员。

07:30.482 --> 07:30.620
[ whistling]
[吹口哨]

07:32.137 --> 07:32.275
Uh, okay, son,
呃，好吧，儿子，

07:34.310 --> 07:34.448
you're starting
to creep me out.
你开始了
让我毛骨悚然。

07:36.275 --> 07:36.413
I knew you'd come back,
Mr. Krabs,
我就知道你会回来
蟹老板先生，

07:38.068 --> 07:38.206
I just knew you would!
我就知道你会的！

07:40.482 --> 07:40.620
Okay, boy, back to work.
好吧，孩子，回去工作吧。

07:42.000 --> 07:42.137
Aye-aye, sir.
是的，先生。

07:43.448 --> 07:43.586
I'm not
your boss anymore.
我不是
你不再是你的老板了。

07:44.620 --> 07:44.758
Just call me Eugene.
就叫我尤金吧。

07:45.793 --> 07:45.931
Aye-aye... Eugene.
是的……尤金。

07:47.896 --> 07:48.000
[ giggles]
[咯咯笑]

07:49.000 --> 07:49.103
Ahoy, Squidward!
嘿，章鱼哥！

07:50.448 --> 07:50.586
Ahoy, Eugene!
哎呀，尤金！

07:52.206 --> 07:52.344
Would you mind clearing
this table for me?
你介意清理吗
这张桌子给我吗？

07:54.965 --> 07:55.068
Sure, Squidward.
当然，章鱼哥。

07:56.586 --> 07:56.724
You know, I've never
seen you so happy.
你知道，我从来没有
看到你这么开心。

07:58.172 --> 07:58.310
They're watching us.
他们在看着我们。

08:01.103 --> 08:01.241
That guy's a real
pain in the hindquarters,
hey, Squiddy?
那个人是一个真正的
后躯疼痛，
嘿，乌贼？

08:04.241 --> 08:04.379
[ laughing]
[笑]

08:05.758 --> 08:07.862
Uh, Eugene, I think
you need to look
呃，尤金，我想
你需要看看

08:07.862 --> 08:07.965
at page 20 of our employee
handbook again.
在我们员工的第 20 页
再次手册。

08:11.413 --> 08:11.551
Oh, I don't need
Carl's silly rules.
哦，我不需要
卡尔的愚蠢规则。

08:13.379 --> 08:13.517
I reallythink you should look.
我真的认为你应该看看。

08:16.551 --> 08:16.689
What's this?
这是什么？

08:17.896 --> 08:18.000
"Help me."
“帮我。”

08:20.068 --> 08:20.206
Hey, fellas, what's
going on over here?
嘿，伙计们，什么是
这里发生什么事了？

08:22.413 --> 08:22.551
Oh, hey, Carl.
哦，嘿，卡尔。

08:23.862 --> 08:23.965
I was just reminding Eugene
我只是提醒尤金

08:26.000 --> 08:26.103
of article 24, section three
第二十四条第三节

08:28.068 --> 08:28.206
of the employee handbook.
的员工手册。

08:30.413 --> 08:30.551
"Cut the chatter
and pick up a platter."
“废话少说
然后端起一个盘子。”

08:32.862 --> 08:32.965
Good job, Squidward.
干得好，章鱼哥。

08:34.551 --> 08:34.689
What have you done
with the real Squidward?
你做了什么
与真正的章鱼哥？

08:36.655 --> 08:36.793
The less you know, Eugene,
the better.
你知道的越少，尤金，
越好。

08:40.068 --> 08:40.206
What's going on around here?
这附近发生了什么事？

08:42.172 --> 08:42.310
Where's SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝在哪里？

08:55.586 --> 08:55.724
Where's the love?
爱在哪里？

08:57.517 --> 08:57.655
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

08:59.103 --> 08:59.241
What happened to
the Krabby Patties?
发生了什么事
蟹肉饼？

09:01.000 --> 09:01.103
I tried to tell them,
我试图告诉他们，

09:02.586 --> 09:02.724
but they wouldn't
listen to me!
但他们不会
听我说！

09:04.517 --> 09:04.655
This is obscene!
这太猥琐了！

09:07.931 --> 09:08.034
Carl!
卡尔！

09:09.137 --> 09:09.275
I need to have a word...
我需要说句话...

09:11.206 --> 09:11.344
Your change is $1.75.
您找的零钱是 1.75 美元。

09:14.000 --> 09:14.103
Automated cash register?!
自动收银机？！

09:16.275 --> 09:16.413
No!
不！

09:19.551 --> 09:19.689
Hey, Carl, what
have you done with
me restaurant?!
嘿，卡尔，什么
你做完了吗
我的餐厅？！

09:22.586 --> 09:22.724
Processed Krabby Patties,
computerized registers...
加工过的蟹肉饼，
计算机化寄存器...

09:25.310 --> 09:25.448
Look around you.
看看你的周围。

09:26.724 --> 09:26.862
Our customers are quite content
我们的客户非常满意

09:28.724 --> 09:28.862
with the contrived
and the mediocre.
与做作的
和平庸的。

09:30.896 --> 09:31.000
[ snoring]
[打鼾]

09:33.000 --> 09:33.137
That's because
they don't know
那是因为
他们不知道

09:35.206 --> 09:35.344
what they're eating.
他们在吃什么。

09:39.379 --> 09:39.517
Excuse me, ma'am,
do you know
对不起，女士，
你知道吗

09:41.379 --> 09:41.517
what's in that Krabby
Patty you're eating?
蟹蟹里有什么
帕蒂，你在吃饭吗？

09:43.620 --> 09:43.758
No.
不。

09:45.310 --> 09:45.448
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

09:47.241 --> 09:47.379
See that?
看到了吗？

09:48.896 --> 09:49.000
Without all your
smoke and mirrors,
没有你的一切
烟与镜，

09:50.448 --> 09:50.586
no one would stomach
this garbage.
没有人会胃口
这个垃圾。

09:51.551 --> 09:51.689
What'd he say?
他说什么？

09:52.551 --> 09:52.689
Garbage?
垃圾？

09:56.896 --> 09:57.000
[ all screaming]
[全都尖叫]

10:00.034 --> 10:00.172
Eugene, you're in violation
of your contract.
尤金，你违规了
你的合同。

10:03.793 --> 10:03.931
Rules!
规则！

10:05.275 --> 10:05.413
Here's a rule for you:
这是给你的规则：

10:07.000 --> 10:07.137
people can't eat stained-glass
barstools!
人们不能吃彩色玻璃
吧凳！

10:10.965 --> 10:11.068
I'll show you automated.
我将向您展示自动化。

10:13.551 --> 10:13.689
Mr. Blandy, code red--
free thinker!
布兰迪先生，红色代码——
自由思想家！

10:21.034 --> 10:21.172
Mr. Krabs, is there
a problem here?
蟹老板，在吗
这里有问题吗？

10:22.827 --> 10:22.965
You better believe it!
你最好相信它！

10:24.655 --> 10:24.793
I used to kiss the ground
you walked on, Blandy,
我曾经亲吻地面
你继续前行，布兰迪，

10:27.000 --> 10:27.103
but after seeing this,
但看到这个之后

10:28.862 --> 10:28.965
I wouldn't even spit
in your direction.
我什至不会吐口水
朝着你的方向。

10:32.172 --> 10:32.310
Krabby Patties are supposed
to be made by hand--
蟹肉饼应该是
需要手工制作——

10:34.827 --> 10:34.965
one at a time--
一次一个——

10:37.793 --> 10:37.931
not on a conveyer belt!
不是在传送带上！

10:39.724 --> 10:39.862
[ rumbling as siren blares]
[如警笛般隆隆作响]

10:44.517 --> 10:44.655
Oh, my...
哦，我的...

10:57.827 --> 10:57.965
Does this mean I won't get
that raise, sir?
这是否意味着我不会得到
加薪吗，先生？

11:03.551 --> 11:03.689
BLANDY:
It's ruined!
布兰迪：
毁了！

11:05.034 --> 11:05.172
We'll have to sell it.
我们必须把它卖掉。

11:06.689 --> 11:06.827
We'll be lucky
if we get a fraction
我们会很幸运
如果我们得到一个分数

11:08.482 --> 11:08.620
of what we paid for it.
我们为此付出的代价。

11:10.482 --> 11:10.620
I'll buy it
for full price.
我会买它
全价。

11:13.275 --> 11:13.413
Sold.
卖。

11:14.965 --> 11:15.068
We won't need
your contract anymore.
我们不需要
你的合同不再存在了。

11:16.310 --> 11:16.448
Nice doing business with you.
很高兴和你做生意。

11:18.344 --> 11:18.482
Pleasure's
all mine.
快乐的
都是我的。

11:20.137 --> 11:20.275
Now get out
of me restaurant.
现在出去
我的餐厅。

11:22.310 --> 11:22.448
[ laughing]
[笑]

11:23.551 --> 11:23.689
Well, we did it, boys.
好吧，我们做到了，孩子们。

11:25.137 --> 11:25.275
The Krusty Krab is ours again.
蟹堡王又是我们的了。

11:27.413 --> 11:27.551
You know, in that fit
of maniacal rage
你知道，在这样的状态下
疯狂的愤怒

11:29.586 --> 11:29.724
I may have destroyed
the restaurant,
我可能已经毁掉了
餐厅,

11:31.758 --> 11:31.896
scared away all our customers
and forced us into bankruptcy--
吓跑了我们所有的顾客
并迫使我们破产——

11:35.103 --> 11:35.241
because I returned
nearly every penny
因为我回来了
几乎每一分钱

11:37.586 --> 11:37.724
I sold this stink-heap for--
我把这个臭堆卖了——

11:40.241 --> 11:40.379
but I got back the love
of me dear friends.
但我找回了爱
我亲爱的朋友们。

11:43.482 --> 11:43.620
Really, Mr. Krabs?
真的吗，蟹老板？

11:44.793 --> 11:44.931
No, not really.
不，不是真的。

11:46.551 --> 11:46.689
Get back to work!
回去工作吧！

11:50.344 --> 11:50.482
[ register jingles]
[注册歌曲]

12:05.862 --> 12:05.965
[ snoring]
[打鼾]

12:08.586 --> 12:08.724
SPONGEBOB:
Oh, Squidward!
海绵宝宝：
哦，章鱼哥！

12:10.793 --> 12:10.931
What do you want, SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝，你想要什么？

12:13.241 --> 12:13.379
Time for work, Squidward.
工作时间到了，章鱼哥。

12:14.931 --> 12:15.034
Another day, another dollar.
又一天，又一美元。

12:16.517 --> 12:16.655
More like another nickel.
更像是另一枚镍币。

12:17.827 --> 12:17.965
[ snickering]
[窃笑]

12:20.275 --> 12:20.413
[ laughs annoyingly]
[烦人地笑]

12:22.344 --> 12:22.482
Good one, Squidward!
好样的，章鱼哥！

12:23.758 --> 12:23.896
[ laughing]
[笑]

12:27.965 --> 12:28.068
Another day, another nickel.
又一天，又一个镍币。

12:31.000 --> 12:31.103
It's not that funny.
这没那么好笑。

12:32.551 --> 12:32.689
That's funny
because it's true.
这很有趣
因为这是真的。

12:34.517 --> 12:34.655
[ SpongeBob laughing
annoyingly]
[海绵宝宝笑
烦人]

12:37.965 --> 12:38.068
Carpool's over.
拼车结束了。

12:41.655 --> 12:41.793
Nickel.
镍。

12:42.758 --> 12:42.896
[ laughs]
[笑]

12:43.827 --> 12:43.965
[ groans]
[呻吟]

12:45.862 --> 12:45.965
Here's your food.
这是你的食物。

12:48.068 --> 12:48.206
[ laughs]
[笑]

12:49.413 --> 12:49.551
It's not that funny!
这没那么好笑！

12:51.965 --> 12:52.068
Please make it stop!
请让它停止！

12:55.241 --> 12:55.379
[ annoying laugh continues]
[烦人的笑声继续]

13:00.068 --> 13:00.206
[ laughter echoing]
[笑声回响]

13:06.758 --> 13:06.896
[ laughter continues]
[笑声继续]

13:17.000 --> 13:17.137
Okay, Squidward,
see you tomorrow.
好吧，章鱼哥，
明天见。

13:19.896 --> 13:20.000
[ annoying laugh trails off
into the distance]
[烦人的笑声渐渐消失
向远方]

13:27.000 --> 13:27.103
And always check
for spare change.
并且经常检查
换零钱。

13:29.862 --> 13:29.965
[ groans]
[呻吟]

13:31.896 --> 13:32.000
Another day, another... nickel!
又一天，又一天……五分钱！

13:35.448 --> 13:35.586
Two Krabby Patties.
两块蟹肉饼。

13:37.034 --> 13:37.172
Thanks, kid.
谢谢，孩子。

13:38.586 --> 13:38.724
Another day,
another nickel.
又一天，
另一个镍币。

13:40.586 --> 13:40.724
[ laughing]
[笑]

13:43.068 --> 13:43.206
Oh.
哦。

13:44.241 --> 13:44.379
[ all laughing]
[全都笑了]

13:46.379 --> 13:46.517
Cease your laughing, tormentor!
停止你的笑吧，折磨者！

13:49.448 --> 13:49.586
[ laughing alternates
with cries of pain]
[笑声交替
伴随着痛苦的呼喊]

13:59.896 --> 14:00.068
This could be my chance.
这可能是我的机会。

14:02.793 --> 14:02.931
SpongeBob,
you don't look well.
海绵宝宝，
你看起来不太好。

14:06.137 --> 14:06.275
I don't?
我不知道？

14:07.172 --> 14:07.310
No.
不。

14:08.344 --> 14:08.482
You should sit down.
你应该坐下来。

14:09.275 --> 14:09.413
Shh...
嘘...

14:10.758 --> 14:10.896
You're burning up,
SpongeBob.
你正在燃烧，
海绵宝宝。

14:12.172 --> 14:12.310
I am?
我是？

14:13.344 --> 14:13.482
Tell me, SpongeBob,
告诉我，海绵宝宝，

14:14.862 --> 14:14.965
have your
sides been hurting?
有你的
双方都受伤了？

14:16.344 --> 14:16.482
Yeah, a little.
是的，有一点。

14:18.000 --> 14:18.137
And your temperature
is 175 degrees!
还有你的温度
是175度！

14:22.241 --> 14:22.379
Is that bad?
那很糟糕吗？

14:23.517 --> 14:23.655
Oh, no, no, no, no, no...
噢，不，不，不，不，不……

14:25.275 --> 14:25.413
unless you've been doing
a lot of... laughing.
除非你一直在做
很多……笑。

14:29.448 --> 14:29.586
I have been laughing
a lot lately.
我一直在笑
最近很多。

14:31.896 --> 14:32.000
[ gasps]
[喘气]

14:32.896 --> 14:33.000
SpongeBob,
海绵宝宝，

14:34.137 --> 14:34.275
you've got to be careful.
你必须小心。

14:35.793 --> 14:35.931
You're going to burn
out your laughbox.
你会燃烧的
出你的笑柄。

14:37.551 --> 14:37.689
My laughbox?
我的笑箱？

14:39.413 --> 14:39.551
Yes, it's the part
of your body
是的，就是这个部分
你身体的

14:41.034 --> 14:41.172
that enables laughter.
这使得笑声成为可能。

14:42.862 --> 14:42.965
If you use it too long
without giving it a break
如果使用时间过长
不休息

14:45.931 --> 14:46.034
it burns out
and you can never
laugh again.
它烧坏了
你永远不能
又笑了。

14:50.586 --> 14:50.724
Is that what happened
to you, Squidward?
难道是这样吗
对你来说，章鱼哥？

14:52.310 --> 14:52.448
Yes... What? No!
是的...什么？不！

14:53.965 --> 14:54.068
Listen, SpongeBob,
this is serious!
听着，海绵宝宝，
这很严重！

14:56.172 --> 14:56.310
If you burn out
your laughbox,
如果你精疲力尽
你的笑箱，

14:58.068 --> 14:58.206
you'll live
your whole life
你会活下去
你的一生

15:00.448 --> 15:00.586
without ever
laughing again.
从来没有
又笑了。

15:02.965 --> 15:03.068
Hey, Patrick, you want
to hear a joke?
嘿，帕特里克，你想要
听个笑话？

15:05.310 --> 15:05.448
Sure, Sandy.
当然，桑迪。

15:06.827 --> 15:06.965
Sure, I'd love
a good laugh.
当然，我愿意
笑得很开心。

15:09.862 --> 15:09.965
What has four
wheels and flies?
什么有四个
轮子和苍蝇？

15:12.655 --> 15:12.793
A garbage truck!
垃圾车！

15:14.034 --> 15:14.172
[ both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

15:16.551 --> 15:16.689
[ flat, mechanical
laughter]
[ 平面、机械
笑声]

15:20.482 --> 15:20.620
[ laughter dies away]
[笑声消失]

15:25.000 --> 15:25.103
I don't want to burn out
my laughbox, Squidward.
我不想烧坏
我的笑柄，章鱼哥。

15:27.551 --> 15:27.689
Well, the most
important thing
is to stop laughing.
嗯，最
重要的事情
就是停止笑。

15:31.517 --> 15:31.655
Any laugh at all
could be dangerous.
任何笑声
可能很危险。

15:34.068 --> 15:34.206
How long do I have
to avoid laughing?
我还有多久
为了避免笑？

15:36.310 --> 15:36.448
Gosh, SpongeBob,
I'd say
天哪，海绵宝宝，
我想说

15:38.620 --> 15:38.758
at least
the rest of the day,
至少
当天剩下的时间，

15:40.413 --> 15:40.551
but you better go 24 hours
just to be safe.
但你最好24小时都去
只是为了安全。

15:43.413 --> 15:43.551
Thank you so much,
Squidward.
非常感谢你，
章鱼哥。

15:45.310 --> 15:45.448
I don't know what
I'd do without you!
我不知道什么
没有你我也行！

15:47.896 --> 15:48.000
A day without laughter
is a small price to pay
没有笑声的一天
是一个很小的代价

15:50.137 --> 15:50.275
to save my laughbox
from destruction.
拯救我的笑点
免遭破坏。

15:52.103 --> 15:52.241
I must remain vigilant.
我必须保持警惕。

15:53.379 --> 15:53.517
Nothing funny over there.
那里没什么好笑的。

15:54.758 --> 15:54.896
Nothing funny over here.
这里没什么好笑的。

15:56.241 --> 15:56.379
PATRICK:
Hey, SpongeBob!
帕特里克：
嘿，海绵宝宝！

15:57.586 --> 15:57.724
How's it going?
怎么样了？

15:59.344 --> 15:59.482
Patrick-- banana peel-- don't!
帕特里克——香蕉皮——别！

16:01.517 --> 16:01.655
What did you say...
你说什么...

16:02.689 --> 16:02.827
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

16:03.689 --> 16:03.827
Oh, no...
哦，不...

16:04.862 --> 16:04.965
Hey, what the...
嘿，这是什么...

16:06.758 --> 16:06.896
Wait a minute, Patrick!
等一下，帕特里克！

16:08.586 --> 16:08.724
Please stop!
请停下来！

16:09.793 --> 16:09.931
Right foot first...
右脚先...

16:11.310 --> 16:11.448
Wait, Patrick,
I can't laugh.
等等，帕特里克，
我笑不出来。

16:12.379 --> 16:12.517
You can't?
你不能吗？

16:13.620 --> 16:13.758
Oh, I know what to do.
哦，我知道该怎么做了。

16:18.103 --> 16:18.241
That usually knocks him out.
这通常会让他崩溃。

16:23.517 --> 16:23.655
[ panting]
[气喘吁吁]

16:25.137 --> 16:25.275
Get a grip on yourself,
SpongeBob.
把握好自己，
海绵宝宝。

16:27.172 --> 16:27.310
You're in control.
你一切尽在掌握。

16:29.620 --> 16:29.758
[ sputtering]
[溅射]

16:32.655 --> 16:32.793
Just back away from
the whoopie cushion, SpongeBob.
刚回来远离
百日咳坐垫，海绵宝宝。

16:34.862 --> 16:34.965
[ sputtering]
[溅射]

16:35.931 --> 16:36.034
[ gasps]
[喘气]

16:37.103 --> 16:37.241
They're everywhere!
他们无处不在！

16:38.172 --> 16:38.310
Everywhere!
到处！

16:41.310 --> 16:41.448
Look out for
that pie truck!
留意
那辆馅饼车！

16:42.758 --> 16:42.896
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

16:49.551 --> 16:49.689
[ tittering]
[窃笑]

16:53.689 --> 16:53.827
I've got to get out of here!
我必须离开这里！

16:55.793 --> 16:55.931
[ cushions sputtering]
[ 坐垫溅射 ]

17:03.137 --> 17:03.275
There's nothing funny up here.
这里没什么好笑的。

17:05.137 --> 17:05.275
But just to be safe...
但只是为了安全起见...

17:12.034 --> 17:12.172
[ crowing]
[鸡鸣]

17:13.758 --> 17:13.896
Ah, I made it 24 hours
without laughing.
啊，我做到了24小时
没有笑。

17:17.241 --> 17:17.379
[ exhales]
[呼气]

17:19.137 --> 17:19.275
That's odd.
这很奇怪。

17:20.275 --> 17:20.413
[ exhales]
[呼气]

17:21.551 --> 17:21.689
I've lost my laugh.
我已经失去了笑声。

17:23.551 --> 17:23.689
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

17:25.103 --> 17:25.241
I've lost my laugh!
我已经笑不出来了！

17:26.275 --> 17:26.413
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

17:29.586 --> 17:29.724
Hi, SpongeBob.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

17:30.827 --> 17:30.965
It's terrible, Patrick--
太可怕了，帕特里克——

17:32.482 --> 17:32.620
I can't laugh anymore.
我再也笑不出来了

17:33.965 --> 17:34.068
What happened?
发生了什么？

17:35.551 --> 17:35.689
I went a whole day
without laughing
我走了一整天
没有笑

17:37.000 --> 17:37.103
and now my laugh is gone.
现在我的笑声消失了。

17:38.517 --> 17:38.655
Let me take a look.
让我看一下。

17:40.517 --> 17:40.655
Hmm... it's dark
in here.
嗯……天黑了
在这里。

17:42.655 --> 17:42.793
I'd better light
a match.
我最好点亮
一场比赛。

17:45.758 --> 17:45.896
[ coughing]
[咳嗽]

17:47.758 --> 17:47.896
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

17:54.103 --> 17:54.241
[ knock at door]
[敲门]

17:55.310 --> 17:55.448
Come in.
进来。

17:56.551 --> 17:56.689
[ sniffling]
[抽鼻子]

17:58.758 --> 17:58.896
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

17:59.931 --> 18:00.103
What's wrong, boy?
怎么了，男孩？

18:01.068 --> 18:01.206
I lost my laugh.
我失去了笑声。

18:03.793 --> 18:03.931
You've come to
the right place, son.
你已经来到
来对地方了，儿子。

18:05.965 --> 18:06.068
You know, there's one thing
that always makes me laugh.
你知道，有一件事
这总是让我发笑。

18:10.758 --> 18:10.896
[ chortling]
[咯咯笑]

18:13.551 --> 18:13.689
Don't it just
tickle you, boy?
难道只是
孩子，挠痒痒了吗？

18:15.413 --> 18:15.551
Not really.
并不真地。

18:17.000 --> 18:17.137
This calls for
drastic measures.
这需要
采取严厉措施。

18:19.000 --> 18:19.103
I don't usually
do this,
我通常不
这样做，

18:20.379 --> 18:20.517
but you seem
desperate.
但你似乎
绝望。

18:21.793 --> 18:21.931
Touch it.
触摸它。

18:26.241 --> 18:26.379
Nothing.
没有什么。

18:27.862 --> 18:27.965
Oh, this is worse
than I thought.
哦，这更糟糕
比我想象的要多。

18:29.655 --> 18:29.793
After all, money is the ultimate
source of joy.
毕竟钱才是最终的
快乐的源泉。

18:31.827 --> 18:31.965
Maybe I should ask Sandy.
也许我应该问桑迪。

18:33.793 --> 18:33.931
She's a scientist.
她是一位科学家。

18:36.068 --> 18:36.206
SANDY:
Oh, it's easy if you approach it
scientifically, SpongeBob.
桑迪：
哦，如果你接近它，这很容易
从科学角度来说，海绵宝宝。

18:39.689 --> 18:39.827
Now, what is laughter?
现在，什么是笑？

18:41.689 --> 18:41.827
The thing that used to give
my life meaning and purpose
曾经给予的东西
我的人生意义和目的

18:44.965 --> 18:45.068
but now mocks me
with its cruel indifference.
但现在却嘲笑我
及其残酷的冷漠。

18:48.137 --> 18:48.275
Scientifically,
it's caused by
从科学角度来说，
这是由

18:49.965 --> 18:50.068
your epiglottis
constricting your larynx,
你的会厌
收缩你的喉咙，

18:52.344 --> 18:52.482
causing irregular air intake
and respiratory upset.
导致进气不规律
和呼吸系统不适。

18:54.620 --> 18:54.758
Sounds painful.
听起来很痛苦。

18:56.241 --> 18:56.379
Science makes everything
sound painful.
科学创造一切
听起来很痛苦。

18:58.655 --> 18:58.793
Now, here's some
humor-theory textbooks,
现在，这里有一些
幽默理论教科书，

19:01.275 --> 19:01.413
laugh mechanics
and the quantum
giggle theory.
笑机制
和量子
咯咯笑理论。

19:03.793 --> 19:03.931
Thank you, Sandy.
谢谢你，桑迪。

19:07.482 --> 19:07.620
Sure is peaceful around here
这里确实很安静

19:09.620 --> 19:09.758
since SquarePants
became a sad sack.
自从方裤
变成了悲伤的麻袋。

19:12.103 --> 19:12.241
I've read all the books,
and still nothing.
所有的书我都读完了
但还是什么都没有。

19:16.000 --> 19:16.137
I guess I'll never laugh again.
我想我再也不会笑了。

19:18.551 --> 19:18.689
[ moaning]
[呻吟]

19:26.655 --> 19:26.793
I really hate to see
the little guy so sad,
我真的很讨厌看到
小家伙好伤心啊

19:30.034 --> 19:30.172
but not as much as I hate
to see him happy.
但没有我讨厌的那么多
看到他幸福。

19:37.137 --> 19:37.275
[ SpongeBob wailing]
[海绵宝宝的哭声]

19:42.793 --> 19:42.931
I think I found the one thing
I hate more than his laugh.
我想我发现了一件事
我讨厌的不仅仅是他的笑声。

19:47.275 --> 19:47.413
I'm sure
he'll cry himself out soon.
我确定
他很快就会哭出来。

19:50.965 --> 19:51.068
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

19:58.241 --> 19:58.379
What have I done?
我做了什么？

20:06.413 --> 20:06.551
Oh, that's it.
哦，就是这样。

20:08.000 --> 20:08.137
This charade has to end!
这场闹剧必须结束了！

20:21.000 --> 20:21.137
Hi, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

20:23.172 --> 20:23.310
SpongeBob, this infernal crying
has to stop!
海绵宝宝，这地狱般的哭泣
必须停下来！

20:26.379 --> 20:26.517
But Squidward, I...
I broke my laughbox!
但是章鱼哥，我...
我打破了我的笑点！

20:29.896 --> 20:30.000
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

20:32.862 --> 20:32.965
SpongeBob, there's
no such thing
as a laughbox!
海绵宝宝，有
没有这样的事
作为一个笑箱！

20:36.379 --> 20:36.517
I made
the whole thing up
我做了
整件事都起来了

20:38.310 --> 20:38.448
to get some peace from
your insipid laughter!
从中得到一些平静
你那平淡的笑声！

20:41.827 --> 20:41.965
You mean my laughbox
isn't broken?
你是说我的笑箱
没坏吗？

20:44.172 --> 20:44.310
And it was a cruel lie
这是一个残酷的谎言

20:45.896 --> 20:46.000
that sent me
into spiraling depression?
那个送我的
陷入螺旋式的抑郁症？

20:47.724 --> 20:47.862
Uh... yeah, well,
it sounds pretty harsh
呃...是的，好吧，
听起来很刺耳

20:50.551 --> 20:50.689
when you put it
that way, but... yeah.
当你把它放在
那样的话，但是……是的。

20:52.931 --> 20:53.034
I could laugh the whole time?
我可以一直笑吗？

20:55.551 --> 20:55.689
Yeah.
是的。

20:57.275 --> 20:57.413
[ annoying laugh returns]
[烦人的笑声再次出现]

20:59.620 --> 20:59.758
[ joins in raucous laughter]
[加入沙哑的笑声]

21:02.965 --> 21:03.068
You really fell for it!
你真的爱上了它！

21:06.758 --> 21:06.896
I guess I did.
我想我做到了。

21:11.965 --> 21:12.068
You even fell
for the old
你还摔倒了
对于旧的

21:13.620 --> 21:13.758
thermometer-in-
the-boiling-oil routine!
温度计在-
沸油例程！

21:16.586 --> 21:16.724
[ screeching
with laughter]
[ 尖叫声
伴随着笑声]

21:18.586 --> 21:18.724
It's not really
that funny, Squidward.
这不是真的
真有趣，章鱼哥。

21:20.620 --> 21:20.758
It's hilarious!
太搞笑了！

21:23.034 --> 21:23.172
See you later,
Squidward.
稍后见，
章鱼哥。

21:24.689 --> 21:24.827
[ laughing wildly]
[狂笑]

21:28.413 --> 21:28.551
Break your laughbox!
打破你的笑点！

21:31.448 --> 21:31.586
What a schlemiel!
真是个施莱米尔！

21:33.655 --> 21:33.793
Whoo-hoo-hoo!
呼呼呼！

21:35.586 --> 21:35.724
[ gagging]
[作呕]

21:41.586 --> 21:41.724
[ siren wails]
[警报声]

21:47.758 --> 21:47.896
Look, he's
waking up.
看，他是
醒来。

21:49.620 --> 21:49.758
Oh... where am I?
哦……我在哪儿？

21:51.689 --> 21:51.827
You're in
the hospital, silly.
你在
医院，傻。

21:53.206 --> 21:53.344
You broke your laughbox.
你打破了你的笑点。

21:54.965 --> 21:55.068
The doctor said it was
the most tiny, dried out,
医生说这是
最小的、干枯的，

21:56.965 --> 21:57.068
underused laughbox
he'd ever laid eyes on.
未充分利用的笑箱
他曾经见过。

21:59.241 --> 21:59.379
So they cut it out.
所以他们把它剪掉了。

22:00.586 --> 22:00.724
Cut it out?
剪掉吗？

22:01.896 --> 22:02.000
Yeah! Want to see it?
是的！想看吗？

22:03.344 --> 22:03.482
It's fun
to shake it up
很有趣
动摇它

22:04.862 --> 22:04.965
and watch it
bounce around.
并观看它
弹来弹去。

22:06.344 --> 22:06.482
Oh, give me!
哦，给我！

22:07.689 --> 22:07.827
Oh, I can never laugh again?
哦，我再也笑不出来了？

22:10.758 --> 22:10.896
Nonsense-- your laugh should be
stronger than ever.
废话——你应该笑
比以往任何时候都更强大。

22:13.655 --> 22:13.793
But you cut out
my laughbox.
但你剪掉了
我的笑箱。

22:16.137 --> 22:16.275
Yes, but one of your friends
has generously allowed us
是的，但是你的一位朋友
慷慨地允许我们

22:19.310 --> 22:19.448
to transplant part of theirs
to you.
移植他们的一部分
给你。

22:22.275 --> 22:22.413
Nope.
没有。

22:23.517 --> 22:23.655
They wouldn't pay me.
他们不会付钱给我。

22:25.068 --> 22:25.206
You're getting warmer.
你越来越暖和了。

22:28.689 --> 22:28.827
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

22:30.241 --> 22:30.379
[ annoying laugh]
[烦人的笑声]

22:31.793 --> 22:31.931
Hey, you laugh
just like me!
嘿嘿，你笑了
就像我一样！

22:35.103 --> 22:35.241
[ both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

22:47.448 --> 22:47.586
Oh, there he goes, off to share
his laughter with the world.
哦，他走了，去分享
他与世界一起欢笑。

22:51.000 --> 22:51.137
[ laughs]
[笑]

